      "content": "it just feels like a debt. like i let something happen and i just stood there. seeing it happen and doing nothing made me realize that i'm not one of the good ones. some people are just born wrong, you know? and the more i live, the more i feel like i'm just taking resources and air away from people who actually deserve it.",
